Alanine Dipeptide
Scan psi with phi fixed. This can be repeated for additional
fixed phi's to yield the 2D phi, psi pmf.
Psi increment = 5 degrees. 500 TIP4P waters are used.

Time: 16 hours on a 2.4 GHz Pentium

Note: The initial dihedral value for atom 19 is set to 0 and the
final value is set to 1 in pmfzmat. This lets the rc (= lambda) values to
be given in degrees in the cmd file.

xPMFQ can be used to submit the job to our queuing system.
E.g., for 10 degree increments for phi, one creates 36 Z-matrix
files, z000, z010, ... z350 with phi set as 0.0, 10.0, ... 350.0.
Then,
ls -1 z* >> xxx
xMANY xxx xPMFQ

submits all 36 jobs to the queue. To complete the 2D pmf, one
needs to run a job in which psi is fixed and phi is varied in the
same manner. Then, the relative free energies of all (phi, psi) points
can be determined.
